# Exclude the reconstructed ARC answer key from archival snapshots (Zenodo, git-archive).
# It stays in the working tree and in normal git history/clones; this only affects
# `git archive` and Zenodo's GitHub auto-archival, which uses git archive under the hood.
# Recovery code (src/harvest_responses.py, src/responses_analysis.py) is unaffected and
# lets anyone regenerate this file themselves. See docs/DATASHEET.md section 6.
substrate/raw/arc_resp.npz export-ignore
